msgctxt "84_Cigarette-starved Prisoner"
msgid "Hey, you got a smoke?"
msgstr "Ey, ¿fumas?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "96_Saejima"
msgid "In here? You outta your damn mind?"
msgstr "¿Aquí? ¿Estás loco?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "108_Cigarette-starved Prisoner"
msgid "Heh, guess you're new in this neck of the woods. A cigarette's the best way to make friends in here. If you don't have 'em... Well, watch your back."
msgstr "Ah, supongo que sos el nuevo. Un cigarrillo es la mejor manera de hacer amigos acá. Si no tenés... bueno, cuidá tu espalda."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "120_Saejima"
msgid "...Huh."
msgstr "......"

